OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFrequent showers are expected,
OL,6,Fsome being heavy and thundery with a
OL,7,Frisk of hail. The most intense showers
OL,8,Fare likely across parts of England and
OL,9,FWales, especially northern and central
OL,10,Fareas. More isolated elsewhere and
OL,11,Ffeeling cooler than of late.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers will mostly fade
OL,14,Fovernight, though some may persist
OL,15,Fnear windward coasts. Elsewhere,
OL,16,Fvariable cloud and clear spells are
OL,17,Fexpected. Temperatures will be cooler
OL,18,Fthan recent nights across many areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
