OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FEarly showers in Northern
OL,6,FIreland will fade, leaving many
OL,7,Fnorthern areas dry with sunny spells.
OL,8,FElsewhere, showers will develop, some
OL,9,Fheavy and thundery. Temperatures near
OL,10,Faverage to cool.
